  m_text: '<size=160%><b>QUAKER</b></size>

    One shared tower


    Everyone builds
    on the one tower base. When it falls, whoever placed last loses that game.

    Enter
    your names clockwise around the table, starting with the tallest player, who
    goes first in round 1. After every round the first player passes clockwise.'
